/**
 * Adds the second operational website-service terms draft.
 */
function famtastic_pipeline_update_8015(&$sandbox) {
  $body = <<<'TERMS'
FAMtastic Designs Website Service Terms — Operational Draft v2

The Web Basics Bundle is a one-time $199 purchase for one focused single-page
or landing-page website. It includes one year of FAMtastic-managed basic hosting
and, when needed, first-year registration of one new standard domain. Customers
using an existing domain receive domain connection instead. The customer owns
the domain and customer-supplied content; FAMtastic manages its hosting systems.

Hosting renewal is optional. If the customer separately authorizes automatic
renewal, basic hosting begins billing at $9.99 per month after the included year.
Before authorization, checkout must clearly display the amount, billing
frequency, start date, and cancellation method. Recurring billing may be
cancelled through the customer portal using the same general method used to
accept it. Cancellation stops future charges and does not retroactively refund
service already delivered. Required renewal notices will be sent electronically
before an applicable cancellation deadline.

Domain renewal is a separate annual prepaid charge disclosed before billing.
Customers connecting an existing domain are not charged a domain-renewal fee.
FAMtastic will not store card numbers; payment details are handled by the
configured payment provider.

The selected package, add-ons, price, scope, revision allowance, and estimated
delivery timing are shown before checkout. Work outside that recorded scope
requires separately accepted pricing. Approval of a proof authorizes deployment
of that release. Customers must have authority to provide all submitted content,
brands, and account access.

Transactional account, project, security, billing, support, and renewal notices
may be sent as necessary to provide purchased services. Promotional messages are
separate, may be disabled in portal settings, and include an unsubscribe method
and FAMtastic Designs' postal address: 1729 NW St. Lucie West Blvd #1181,
Port Saint Lucie, FL 34986, United States.

This is an operational draft for test-mode implementation and must receive
qualified legal review before live recurring charges or public launch.
TERMS;
  $database = \Drupal::database();
  $database->update('famtastic_terms_version')->fields(['active' => 0])
    ->condition('terms_key', 'website_service')->execute();
  $database->merge('famtastic_terms_version')
    ->key('terms_key', 'website_service')->key('version', 2)
    ->fields([
      'checksum' => hash('sha256', $body),
      'document_url' => '/terms/website-service-v2',
      'body' => $body,
      'effective_at' => 0,
      'active' => 1,
      'created' => \Drupal::time()->getRequestTime(),
    ])->execute();
  return t('Added website service operational terms draft v2 for test-mode checkout.');
}

